nd Katie Fitch.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rp8bFd0p5T1vhKqDh6VVvqVUUqR.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2009-01-22\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Everyone\",\"overview\":\"It's the first day of the new term at Roundview College, and best friends Freddie, JJ and Cook's world collides with Effy's.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/grQ6c2HBvA0O1nPHRwJtFqBKPJu.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":14,\"airDate\":\"2009-01-22\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Cook\",\"overview\":\"It's Cook's 17th birthday, and half the college have been invited to his Uncle Keith's pub to witness a night Cook believes will go down in history.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2opZOKgZOZEnPknHsiit3wOnVBG.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"voteCount\":13,\"airDate\":\"2009-01-29\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Thomas\",\"overview\":\"Thomas arrives in the UK from Congo alone. His family are due to join him in a few days - he must find somewhere for them to live so he moves into an abandoned flat on an estate.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d3JOP5sBae2PosIWVeoWTL3CJp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":11,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-05\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Pandora\",\"overview\":\"The first and only boy Pandora's ever fancied has been deported before she's got beyond first base. But her lovesickness has to take a backseat when the Jim/Anthea/Steve love triangle is blown open.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dh8naFqtJqseCtZzCaFnt4pZZCc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":13,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-12\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Freddie\",\"overview\":\"Freddie's big sister Karen has reached the final of a TV talent show. Freddie is emotionally blackmailed into upholding the story she and her dad are spinning about their dead mother, all to look good in front of the cameras.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ytOMPFG6s9TJFLJNSqHloZFWk0o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":10,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-19\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Naomi\",\"overview\":\"Naomi thinks she's got her world worked out - but her super smart exterior hides the insecurities beneath, and when the student president elections are announced, it stirs her into questioning what she really wants.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qFzzxvkRQLxD8kKRdhyGWrqmg8J.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":10,\"airDate\":\"2009-02-26\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"JJ\",\"overview\":\"Poor JJ. Everything's gone pear-shaped since Effy came between his two best friends and split apart his friendship group - but Emily proves to be a true friend in his hour of need.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qyXiHygNiTRXCmZyOcCGyuu2WqH.jpg\",\"rating\":8.8,\"voteCount\":11,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-05\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Effy\",\"overview\":\"Effy's lost her mojo. Mindless sex with Cook no longer satisfies her and things in the Stonem household are becoming intolerable.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ePZfgRaqcYNIIa589EJ1Vh0CCzf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"voteCount\":12,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-12\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Katie and Emily\",\"overview\":\"Katie is too humiliated from the incident in the woods to leave the house. Lucky she's got Emily to bail her out.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4Umbi5NkzHnr6b0MFAY4xB6Ey3C.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":12,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-19\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Finale\",\"overview\":\"Outlaws Cook and Effy are running wild, clinging to each other and blocking out the rest of the world by getting totally off their faces.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ybZzJazA1Pkso3FM7mWUTW2ZiIF.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":12,\"airDate\":\"2009-03-26\",\"runtime\":45}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2007-01-25\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}